    "intro": "Two summer weeks across three very different Chinas. Hangzhou for my mom's wontons and slow lake evenings; Chongqing for cyberpunk dreams, river lights, and noodles that left me sweating into my soup; Wulong for cliffs that swallowed everything human-sized. I traveled with my parents - first time in a while - and admired how things had changed since the last time I visited.",
